Package: meshcentral-desktop
Version: 2.9.3
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3, python3-gi, python3-websocket, python3-cairo,
 gir1.2-gtk-3.0, gir1.2-vte-2.91, gir1.2-secret-1, gir1.2-webkit2-4.1
Recommends: xdg-utils, gnome-keyring
Maintainer: Denis Maggipinto (CYVELION LTD) <d.maggipinto@cyvelion.co.uk>
Homepage: https://github.com/d-maggipinto/meshcentral-desktop
Description: Native desktop client for MeshCentral
 A native GTK application for managing devices on a MeshCentral server.
 Connect with a server address, username, password and optional two-factor
 code. Browse device groups, run power actions and commands, open a native
 terminal and file manager for each device, and launch remote desktop
 sessions - all in dedicated native windows rather than a browser tab.
